{"text": " So what could medicine look like in 2100? That morning hasn't happened yet, but we can follow the evidence. The United Nations expects life expectancy worldwide to reach about 82 by 2100, but some of our best drugs are wearing out. In 2021, 1.1 million deaths were directly caused by bacteria that resist antibiotics, and resistance played a part in 4.7 million more. A study in the Lancet forecast that, without more action, resistant infections could directly cause about 1.9 million deaths a year by 2050. So here's one scenario, not O-fact. If we keep testing and keep our drugs working, a baby born in 2100 could live past 80. If resistance keeps rising, some of the cures from 1941 might fail. In 1799, doctors trusted authority. In 2100, what will you trust?", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 2.16, "text": " So what could medicine look like in 2100?", "tokens": [50364, 407, 437, 727, 7195, 574, 411, 294, 5080, 628, 30, 50498], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11492646068607995, "compression_ratio": 1.4852941176470589, "no_speech_prob": 0.017170481383800507, "words": [{"word": " So", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.16, "probability": 0.7519474029541016}, {"word": " what", "start": 0.16, "end": 0.34, "probability": 0.8838229179382324}, {"word": " could", "start": 0.34, "end": 0.48, "probability": 0.9819833040237427}, {"word": " medicine", "start": 0.48, "end": 0.8, "probability": 0.9867604970932007}, {"word": " look", "start": 0.8, "end": 1.08, "probability": 0.9960808157920837}, {"word": " like", "start": 1.08, "end": 1.24, "probability": 0.9954953193664551}, {"word": " in", "start": 1.24, "end": 1.44, "probability": 0.9928394556045532}, {"word": " 2100?", "start": 1.44, "end": 2.16, "probability": 0.7914391458034515}]}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 2.62, "end": 4.12, "text": " That morning hasn't happened yet,", "tokens": [50498, 663, 2446, 6132, 380, 2011, 1939, 11, 50606], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11492646068607995, "compres